WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.328 --> 00:00:05.558
- Magic to me is the feeling
that you get Christmas Eve

00:00:05.558 --> 00:00:09.209
when Santa Claus comes to your
home and delivers presents.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.753
- Botania.

00:00:10.753 --> 00:00:12.745
The smile on children's
faces when the rabbit

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:16.799
suddenly appears, they know that's magic.

00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:19.943
- It's my passion, it's my
hobby, it's my vocation.

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:21.776
It's everything to me.

00:00:26.436 --> 00:00:27.853
- Welcome to Colon, Michigan.

00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:29.855
- The magic capital of the world.

00:00:29.855 --> 00:00:31.416
- I am John Sterlini, the owner

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.525
of Sterlini Magic Manufacturing.

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:36.157
- My name is Rick Fisher,
I'm the president and CEO

00:00:36.157 --> 00:00:38.358
of the Fab Magic company.

00:00:38.358 --> 00:00:40.248
- I am Greg Bordner,
and I am the president

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:42.038
of Abbott's Magic.

00:00:42.038 --> 00:00:44.649
I brought a good book with
me, it's called the Bible.

00:00:44.649 --> 00:00:47.053
Sometimes there's some
really cool parts in here.

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:50.303
There's really some fire and brimstone.

00:00:54.735 --> 00:00:56.890
There are three magic
shops in Colon, Michigan

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.450
and we're about three blocks apart.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.470
- Directly next to me is Fab Magic

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:06.391
and Abbott's Magic is
located one block west of us.

00:01:06.391 --> 00:01:08.220
- [Greg] There's a lot of
little things here in Colon.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.845
There are top hats in the street

00:01:09.845 --> 00:01:12.857
with flowers blooming in them.

00:01:12.857 --> 00:01:14.263
- We have one pizza parlor.

00:01:14.263 --> 00:01:15.785
We have two gas stations.

00:01:15.785 --> 00:01:18.618
- We only have one blinking light.

00:01:21.046 --> 00:01:23.032
- [John] We have a
magician's walk of fame.

00:01:23.032 --> 00:01:26.316
- It's kinda like our very
own Hollywood walk of fame.

00:01:26.316 --> 00:01:29.663
Our high school mascot
is the Fighting Magi.

00:01:29.663 --> 00:01:31.169
- [Greg] There's the Magic City Hardware,

00:01:31.169 --> 00:01:32.961
there's Illusions Hair Care.

00:01:32.961 --> 00:01:34.626
- And we have three magic shops all

00:01:34.626 --> 00:01:37.320
in a town of 1,200 people.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.381
I'll share this with you,
if Colon was any smaller

00:01:40.381 --> 00:01:42.464
they'd call it semicolon.

00:01:43.764 --> 00:01:44.597
Bad joke.

00:01:45.665 --> 00:01:46.748
Yes bad joke.

00:01:51.624 --> 00:01:54.352
- Abbott's Magic began
doing the magic convention

00:01:54.352 --> 00:01:55.852
80-some years ago.

00:01:57.012 --> 00:02:00.021
We've had thousands of
magicians from around the world

00:02:00.021 --> 00:02:01.586
that gather here to learn,

00:02:01.586 --> 00:02:04.419
to share their knowledge of magic.

00:02:07.657 --> 00:02:10.363
- When you perform a magic
trick and a little kid smiles,

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.504
and he goes "wow,” and you
can see the magic in his face,

00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:16.479
that's really the best part.

00:02:16.479 --> 00:02:20.481
- For that 15, 20 minutes,
hour, you hopefully took

00:02:20.481 --> 00:02:23.981
that person from this world to this world.

00:02:25.888 --> 00:02:28.338
- I always said to my
parents even as a young kid,

00:02:28.338 --> 00:02:29.823
"I'm gonna move up here one of these days

00:02:29.823 --> 00:02:32.706
"and I'm gonna own a magic shop".

00:02:32.706 --> 00:02:34.071
- [Voiceover] So dreams do come true.

00:02:34.071 --> 00:02:35.738
- They do come true.

